---
import Icon from "../shared/Icon.astro";
import SectionLabel from "./SectionLabel.astro";
---

<section class="home-section container">
  <SectionLabel label="Why Novage" accent="The case in three points" />
  <div class="reasons">
    <article class="reason">
      <div class="icon-round">
        <Icon name="trophy" />
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Ownership, not staffing</h3>
        <p>
          Typical firms rent out developers and rotate them between accounts. We
          take ownership of the outcome — which is why our typical clients stay
          with us <strong>for many years</strong>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>
    <article class="reason">
      <div class="icon-round">
        <Icon name="users" />
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>One accountable team</h3>
        <p>
          Design, engineering, QA, and delivery under one roof — no hand-offs
          between vendors, no gap between "built" and "shipped". A single team
          answers for the result.
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>
    <article class="reason">
      <div class="icon-round">
        <Icon name="code" />
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Proof in production</h3>
        <p>
          Our main client and largest project: <strong>Yembo</strong>, a startup
          building AI for the moving and insurance industries, deployed in{" "}
          <strong>40+ countries</strong> and processing{" "}
          <strong>millions of videos</strong> — engineered with us as its
          partner for seven years.{" "}
          <a href="/case-studies/yembo">Read the case study</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
  <p class="note">
    <Icon name="zap" class="note-icon" />
    <span>
      <strong>Delivery that doesn't stop:</strong> a distributed team with
      redundant power and connectivity — our clients' releases have continued
      uninterrupted.
    </span>
  </p>
</section>
